<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><title>{{ title }}</title>
<body><h1>{{ title }}</h1><p>Campaign: {{ campaign_id }} — {{ date }}</p>
<p>Research prototype. Results are uncalibrated and are not experimental validation.</p>
<h2>Methods and assumptions</h2><p>Masked theta diffusion with local implicit reaction splitting (first order overall), insulated inactive faces and fixed feeder reservoirs. Migration uses conservative upwind face fluxes. Film growth uses consumed monomer at one effective exposed face per electrode cell.</p>
<p>Stage A is an imposed diffusion/reaction surrogate. Stages B/C add phenomenological field enhancement. Stage D balances a phenomenological signed BV proxy with anodic-only deposition, under a prescribed solution field. No self-consistent electrolyte/electrode current coupling, calibrated counter-reaction, evolving geometry, convection or experimental calibration is included. Molar flux per depth is not measured current.</p>
<h2>Actual run configurations</h2>{% for config in run_configs %}<pre>{{ config | tojson(indent=2) }}</pre>{% endfor %}
<h2>Tables</h2>{% for key, table in tables.items() %}<h3>{{ key }}</h3>{{ table }}{% endfor %}
<h2>Figures</h2>{% for fig in figures %}<figure><img src="{{ fig.path }}" alt="{{ fig.caption }}"><figcaption>{{ fig.caption }}</figcaption></figure>{% endfor %}</body></html>